.TH DELETE_MODULE 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
delete_module \- removes a kernel module; requires cap_sys_module and may be disabled
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/module.h>
.B int delete_module(const char* name, unsigned int flags);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Removes a kernel module; requires CAP_SYS_MODULE and may be disabled.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR delete_module (2)
